      ["A senhora precisa de ajuda?","ah seh-NYAW-ruh preh-SEE-zuh jee ah-ZHOO-duh","Do you need help? (to an older woman)","a senhora takes the ele form: precisa."],
      ["Tome este remédio duas vezes por dia.","TOH-mee AYS-chee heh-MEH-jyoo DOO-uhs VAY-zees pohr JEE-uh","Take this medicine twice a day.","o remédio = medicine. duas agrees with vezes, which is feminine."],
      ["Eu tenho plano de saúde.","ayw TAY-nyoo PLAH-noo jee sah-OO-jee","I have health insurance.","Private health insurance in Brazil is o plano de saúde."],
      ["Estou resfriado.","ees-TOH hehs-free-AH-doo","I have a cold.","A woman says resfriada."]
