      ["Ela está trabalhando agora.","EH-luh ees-TAH trah-bah-LYAHN-doo ah-GAW-ruh","She's working right now.","estar + -ndo: está trabalhando."],
      ["Eu estudo à noite.","ayw ees-TOO-doo ah NOY-chee","I study at night.","à noite = at night, in the evening; de manhã = in the morning."],
      ["a prova","ah PRAW-vuh","the test; the exam",""],
      ["Como se diz isso em português?","KOH-moo see jees EE-soo ayng pohr-too-GAYS","How do you say this in Portuguese?",""],
      ["a lição de casa","ah lee-SOWNG jee KAH-zuh","the homework","Also: o dever de casa."],
      ["Estou procurando emprego.","ees-TOH proh-koo-RAHN-doo aym-PRAY-goo","I'm looking for a job.","o emprego = a job, employment."],
      ["o salário","oo sah-LAH-ryoo","the salary; pay",""],
      ["Nós trabalhamos juntos.","naws trah-bah-LYAH-moos ZHOON-toos","We work together.","The nós form ends in -amos. Two women say juntas."]
